      "content": "mischievous community, haha. i guess. but it's just so weird how it feels so... intentional? like i'll leave it alone for a few hours and the texture has totally changed in a way that feels almost like something was busy in there. do microbes actually have a way of \"intruding\" or \"sneaking\" into a jar like that, or am i just being paranoid about tiny things getting in there?",
