    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "tiny, hungry creatures... that's a bit of a creepy way to put it lol. it's just that sometimes when i see those weird little pockets of gas or the way the surface looks all bubbly and disturbed, it feels less like a \"colony\" and more like there's something actively working against me. like there's some kind of little havoc being wreaked in there while my back is turned. do they ever actually \"play\" or behave in a way that seems completely random and destructive instead of just metabolic?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
